# Architecture boundaries

Projects:
- Installer.App = WPF presentation and view orchestration only.
- Installer.Core = domain models, service abstractions, business logic.
- Installer.Infrastructure = process, filesystem, logging, packaging, OS integration.
- Installer.Contracts = DTOs and schemas only.

Rules:
- UI must depend on Core abstractions, not Infrastructure concrete types directly.
- ViewModels may call service interfaces only.
- adb execution lives in Infrastructure/Core services, never in XAML code-behind.
- Do not introduce static god classes.
- Prefer small service classes with narrow responsibility.
- Keep methods short and testable.